{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The task-local heap fits the VM’s current state model, but the ruling needs two corrections: boxing only reassigned locals misses some Python bindings, and sealing a continuation’s ID alone would leave its control payload open to tampering. I’m checking the primitive call path to make the effect-forgery fix concrete."}}
